# Local Development Port

Port 3000 is reserved for another project. Do not start this app on port 3000.

- Default local URL: `http://localhost:3002`
- `npm run dev` must use port 3002
- Do not terminate, replace, or kill processes on port 3000
- If port 3002 is occupied, report the conflict instead of killing another process
- Port 3002 is local-development only; production must not depend on it
